TARGET B: Does β₁ satisfy deletion-contraction?
If YES → O(2^n) β₁ instead of O(n³) matrix rank
========================================================================

  n=4:
    ✓ β₁ IS determined by deletion signature at n=4
    del_betas=[0, 0, 0, 0] → β₁=0  (sum=0, max=0)
    del_betas=[0, 0, 0, 1] → β₁=0  (sum=1, max=1)
    del_betas=[0, 0, 1, 0] → β₁=0  (sum=1, max=1)
    del_betas=[0, 0, 1, 1] → β₁=1  (sum=2, max=1)
    del_betas=[0, 1, 0, 0] → β₁=0  (sum=1, max=1)
    del_betas=[0, 1, 0, 1] → β₁=1  (sum=2, max=1)
